      <marc:subfield code="a">THE LAW ON DANGEROUS DRUGS IN MALAYSIA : (DANGEROUS DRUGS ACT, SPECIAL PREVENTIVE MEASURES &amp; FORFEITURE OF PROPERTY)</marc:subfield>
